<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kitty Hawk said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kitty Hawk said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney upgraded Kitty Hawk Inc to outperform from neutral, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/8 to 12-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
